# pseudocode source: chapters/ch93.tex:59
# caption: Compile a typed expression into structured code producing one value.

REQUIRE validated typed expression and lexical binding contract
ENSURE code block with net one result under the strict semantics
literals and variables emit CONST or LOAD
lambdas emit CLOSURE with parameter and compiled body block
binary primitives emit left block, right block, then consuming opcode
applications emit function block, argument block, then APP
conditionals emit test block and IF holding two separate branch blocks
lets and cases retain their lexical binders and nested compiled blocks
verify stack effects and branch result compatibility

